<title>USA: Humana Inc sells Alabama operations.</title>
<headline>Humana Inc sells Alabama operations.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Humana Inc said Thursday it had signed a definitive agreement to sell its operations in the state of Alabama to PrimeHealth of Alabama Inc.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the company, who declined to disclose the terms of the deal, said Humana hoped to close it during the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The company will settle the deal mostly in cash, she said without elaborating.</p>
<p>The operations provide managed health care products to about 30,000 members in Alabama.</p>
<p>Humana is a managed health care company.</p>
</text>
